This photo shows leftovers rather than a full meal. The right plate has orange sauce residue with a few dark bits, and the left plate has a few small brown pieces, possibly mushrooms or dried fruit. There is also an empty wrapper and a glass of water. I estimated the amount of food still on the plates.

The sauce smear is roughly 15 g, at about 1.5 kcal/g of oily sauce, which gives around 25 kcal. The scraps on the left plate are about 5 g, or around 10 kcal. That comes to about 20 g and 35 kcal in total.

